<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian govt says jobs forecast on track.</title>
<headline>Australian govt says jobs forecast on track.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian government said on Monday its jobs forecast for two percent through year employment growth in 1996/97 was right on track.  </p>
<p>&quot;The budget forecast of two percent employment growth is right on track,&quot; Assistant Treasurer Rod Kemp told Parliament.</p>
</text>
